  "solution": {
    "text": "For a compound to be aromatic,\r\n(i) It should be planar\r\n(ii) it should have $(4 n+2) \\pi$ electrons\r\n(iii) It should be able to delocalise its $\\pi$ electron density.\r\nAmong the given compounds. 1,3,5,7 -cyclooctatetraene or cyclooctatetraene is not aromatic as its structure is non-planar.\r\n<img src=\"assets\\st0025_70509cb54059.png\">"
  }
